WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.994
"When watching TV, keep the lights
on and don't sit too close."

00:00:19.019 --> 00:00:22.856
In my hometown,
they always picked on me.

00:00:22.856 --> 00:00:25.859
The guys would take turns saying
which girl they liked,

00:00:25.859 --> 00:00:27.961
and they'd stop with me...

00:00:27.961 --> 00:00:33.700
- Hey, listen up, everybody!
- Yoshidayama likes Aikawa in Group 5!

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:34.689
Huh?!

00:00:35.535 --> 00:00:38.538
Hey, Yoshidayama!
What's the big idea?!

00:00:38.538 --> 00:00:39.539
Huh?!

00:00:39.539 --> 00:00:41.975
- Stupid!
- What the heck is he doing?

00:00:41.975 --> 00:00:44.544
- Geez.
- Dork!

00:00:44.544 --> 00:00:46.046
Everybody agreed to cut class,

00:00:46.046 --> 00:00:49.549
but they all suddenly went back
without telling me...

00:00:49.549 --> 00:00:54.387
My three years of middle school
were like living in hell.

00:00:54.387 --> 00:00:56.556
I studied hard...

00:00:56.556 --> 00:00:59.650
and got into this city high school.

00:01:03.329 --> 00:01:04.731
Ow!

00:01:04.731 --> 00:01:06.166
I'm sorry.

00:01:06.166 --> 00:01:10.003
Yes! Here, I can win!
That's what I thought!

00:01:10.003 --> 00:01:11.061
But...

00:01:16.009 --> 00:01:18.170
The Devil was here!

00:01:19.846 --> 00:01:26.186
Dammit. If not for Harima-san,
I could be ruling the school.

00:01:26.186 --> 00:01:28.221
That's right. This is all wrong!

00:01:28.221 --> 00:01:30.190
It wasn't supposed to be this way.

00:01:30.190 --> 00:01:35.361
I've been forming my "Delinquent's
3 Kingdoms Unification Plan"

00:01:35.361 --> 00:01:36.696
before I even got into this school.

00:01:36.696 --> 00:01:38.531
But!

00:01:38.531 --> 00:01:41.868
I wasn't gonna give up so easily.

00:01:41.868 --> 00:01:45.872
I'd pretend to be Harima's follower
and wait for my chance...

00:01:45.872 --> 00:01:49.103
D. Harima-san, you're in 2-D...

00:01:49.876 --> 00:01:52.310
I-I'm sorry.

00:01:53.546 --> 00:01:56.879
I'm gonna get up there... I swear.

00:02:03.656 --> 00:02:10.497
There's something I want
to tell you, but it's too heavy

00:02:10.497 --> 00:02:16.402
Just like this, it seems I must break

00:02:18.638 --> 00:02:25.678
There are too many of
these indescribable feelings

00:02:25.678 --> 00:02:32.242
I cannot deliver them to you,
though you are near, the distance is great

00:02:33.853 --> 00:02:41.027
Forever only looking up
at the blue sky is no good

00:02:41.027 --> 00:02:48.668
Spinning around (spinning around)...
Spinning around (spinning around)...

00:02:48.668 --> 00:02:55.775
Unsteadily mustering strength,
I want to try diving into your heart

00:02:55.775 --> 00:03:03.283
Spinning around (spinning around)...
Spinning around (spinning around)...

00:03:03.283 --> 00:03:12.590
Lightly floating, again today
I am alone above the clouds

00:03:27.006 --> 00:03:33.012
"We meet again! After all,
didn't I say we would?"

00:03:33.012 --> 00:03:37.050
"1st Term Refresher Course, the series'
B side... Well, yes and no..."

00:03:39.185 --> 00:03:41.585
"After the Opening Day Ceremony"

00:03:44.857 --> 00:03:47.849
You're all alone, aren't you?
Aren't you lonely?

00:03:49.195 --> 00:03:54.367
Come here. I just came to this country,
and I don't know anyone.

00:03:54.367 --> 00:03:56.358
See? Aren't I just like you?

00:04:01.474 --> 00:04:06.411
It didn't work. Oh, dear.
She didn't like me at all.

00:04:08.147 --> 00:04:09.637
Huh?

00:04:19.325 --> 00:04:21.995
So cute! Holding a kitty...

00:04:21.995 --> 00:04:24.264
She's like the Goddess of Spring napping.

00:04:24.264 --> 00:04:26.165
Oh? Isn't that Ms. Tsukamoto in 1-D?

00:04:26.165 --> 00:04:29.002
She really does look
like a virginal princess.

00:04:29.002 --> 00:04:31.671
I'd just look like I was asleep.

00:04:31.671 --> 00:04:33.506
I'd never look like a pretty picture.

00:04:33.506 --> 00:04:36.600
Yeah! I'd be hesitant to approach her...

00:04:49.522 --> 00:04:51.991
"Tanaka Store"

00:04:51.991 --> 00:04:53.925
"Closed for the day"

00:04:54.360 --> 00:04:57.193
Oh, no. I overslept.

00:04:58.031 --> 00:05:00.967
You oversleep too much!
No matter what!

00:05:00.967 --> 00:05:03.636
You sleep a lot, don't you, Yakumo?

00:05:03.636 --> 00:05:07.807
I'm sorry. I missed
the sale at the store.

00:05:07.807 --> 00:05:08.975
"Tanaka Store"
Huh?

00:05:08.975 --> 00:05:13.479
Heh, heh, heh. I went
and bought the groceries.

00:05:13.479 --> 00:05:15.982
I know what you always do.

00:05:15.982 --> 00:05:17.317
Thank you...

00:05:17.317 --> 00:05:18.341
Sure!

00:05:20.653 --> 00:05:25.992
Still, can't you do something about
falling asleep anywhere at any time?

00:05:25.992 --> 00:05:29.662
I think it's a bigger problem than
just the dinnertime groceries.

00:05:29.662 --> 00:05:30.663
Yes...

00:05:30.663 --> 00:05:33.333
Don't you have a friend
who can wake you?

00:05:33.333 --> 00:05:36.461
Yes. I had lori wake me up.

00:05:37.337 --> 00:05:39.066
You're impossible...

00:05:41.174 --> 00:05:44.143
You're coming too. Right, Tsukamoto?
Karaoke with us.

00:05:44.143 --> 00:05:48.147
Yeah, the girls nagged us to ask you.

00:05:48.147 --> 00:05:51.284
Tsukamoto's still unattached.

00:05:51.284 --> 00:05:53.252
Maybe I've got a chance with her.

00:05:53.252 --> 00:05:59.350
Uh, oh... I... I'm meeting
a friend in the courtyard.

00:06:06.299 --> 00:06:10.292
I'm starting to see it again.
It's getting stronger.

00:06:12.138 --> 00:06:14.971
I've got... to bear it.

00:06:16.309 --> 00:06:18.800
Like this, alone...

00:06:23.149 --> 00:06:25.084
Hey, look at that!

00:06:25.084 --> 00:06:26.986
Will that black cat be okay?

00:06:26.986 --> 00:06:29.822
That stray dog is really mad.

00:06:29.822 --> 00:06:34.088
Isn't that the black cat? The girl
we see around recently gave it a name.

00:06:44.170 --> 00:06:45.330
Iori?!

00:06:51.677 --> 00:06:53.346
I'm afraid of dogs!

00:06:53.346 --> 00:06:54.506
Someone...

00:06:57.350 --> 00:07:00.620
- Hey, that's Tsukamoto, for you.
- She's so cool.

00:07:00.620 --> 00:07:02.789
She'll probably get rid
of that dog real easy.

00:07:02.789 --> 00:07:04.624
- I'm in love. For real!
- She can do anything!

00:07:04.624 --> 00:07:07.457
- What a woman.
- Go for it!

00:07:09.462 --> 00:07:10.451
Woof!

00:07:14.300 --> 00:07:15.635
Uh... Woof?

00:07:15.635 --> 00:07:17.068
Did that girl say it?

00:07:25.478 --> 00:07:27.613
Whoa! That girl's awesome!

00:07:27.613 --> 00:07:29.315
- Who is she?
- Never saw her before.

00:07:29.315 --> 00:07:32.351
- Isn't she first-year?
- Ain't she kinda cute?

00:07:32.351 --> 00:07:35.411
Oh, um... Thank you very much...

00:07:40.326 --> 00:07:42.317
I was so scared!

00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:49.735
Are you all right?

00:07:49.735 --> 00:07:52.672
Y-Yes... Thank you very much.

00:07:52.672 --> 00:07:54.173
That's good.

00:07:54.173 --> 00:07:56.008
Um... Who are you?

00:07:56.008 --> 00:08:01.275
Huh? Oh, my name is Sara Adiemas.
I'm from Britain.

00:08:22.802 --> 00:08:24.599
Was it a dream?

00:08:26.639 --> 00:08:28.808
Oh, you're finally up.

00:08:28.808 --> 00:08:31.606
Shall we go home, Yakumo?

00:08:39.318 --> 00:08:43.322
I'm sorry. You were sleeping
so soundly, that I didn't...

00:08:43.322 --> 00:08:45.491
Were you having a nice dream?

00:08:45.491 --> 00:08:47.326
Yes...

00:08:47.326 --> 00:08:50.989
Sorry, Sis. I'm late again...

00:08:58.004 --> 00:09:00.939
"After the Class Change"

00:09:04.277 --> 00:09:10.238
After the class change, Tenma Tsukamoto
was in the same class as Oji Karasuma.

00:09:10.950 --> 00:09:16.122
But that didn't mean that
her battle had ended.

00:09:16.122 --> 00:09:20.960
So tomorrow, your seat
assignments will change.

00:09:20.960 --> 00:09:24.396
Right! I've got to get a seat
next to Karasuma-kun!

00:09:25.965 --> 00:09:29.969
But how?!

00:09:29.969 --> 00:09:32.638
Aren't seat assignments
made by drawing lots?

00:09:32.638 --> 00:09:34.697
It's no use crying about it.

00:09:35.474 --> 00:09:38.644
- It's better to bathe
and go to bed early...
- That's mean!

00:09:38.644 --> 00:09:42.671
Try to understand.
Your older sister's in love!

00:09:45.151 --> 00:09:48.518
Good grief! Treating me like a kid...

00:09:50.990 --> 00:09:53.659
I'm...

00:09:53.659 --> 00:09:55.995
in high school.

00:09:55.995 --> 00:09:57.496
That's why...

00:09:57.496 --> 00:10:00.431
I want to do everything I can.

00:10:04.503 --> 00:10:07.506
Star!! This card has a star!

00:10:07.506 --> 00:10:08.973
An X!?

00:10:12.011 --> 00:10:16.515
Why?! My predictions didn't work!

00:10:16.515 --> 00:10:18.949
Bending the spoon is easy...

00:10:24.523 --> 00:10:25.990
Karasuma-kun...

00:10:28.027 --> 00:10:29.895
I can't be feeling depressed!

00:10:29.895 --> 00:10:32.031
I haven't got any time!

00:10:32.031 --> 00:10:34.022
I'll get the seat through will power!

00:10:36.002 --> 00:10:38.368
We'll change seats now.

00:10:40.373 --> 00:10:46.646
Possible seats are back, side,
diagonally back, front, diagonally front!

00:10:46.646 --> 00:10:48.781
It should be all right,
with so many choices...

00:10:48.781 --> 00:10:51.875
Let's see, where's Karasuma-kun's seat?

00:10:54.520 --> 00:10:56.322
Last seat by the window!!

00:10:56.322 --> 00:10:58.724
My choices are suddenly
drastically reduced!

00:10:58.724 --> 00:11:02.328
And the only seat left
is in the front!

00:11:02.328 --> 00:11:04.497
Lot number 6!

00:11:04.497 --> 00:11:05.998
Next...

00:11:05.998 --> 00:11:07.158
Tsukamoto-san...

00:11:08.100 --> 00:11:10.933
Please, #6! Come to me!

00:11:23.015 --> 00:11:26.185
Huh? I just saw #6!

00:11:26.185 --> 00:11:28.354
But isn't this cheating?

00:11:28.354 --> 00:11:30.356
No, it's not!

00:11:30.356 --> 00:11:32.858
This is... yes!

00:11:32.858 --> 00:11:36.529
Heaven's will! It's mine!

00:11:36.529 --> 00:11:37.496
Huh!?

00:11:39.198 --> 00:11:40.866
I did it, I did it!

00:11:40.866 --> 00:11:43.027
I have the seat in front
of Karasuma-kun!

00:11:44.036 --> 00:11:47.164
Ka-ra-su-ma-kun.

00:11:48.040 --> 00:11:50.042
Hey!!

00:11:50.042 --> 00:11:52.445
- Is that #6?!
- Yup.

00:11:52.445 --> 00:11:54.246
But I just picked #6!

00:11:54.246 --> 00:11:56.271
Ohh. Let's see.

00:11:59.218 --> 00:12:01.320
- Did you see this?
- Huh?

00:12:01.320 --> 00:12:03.652
See this dot?

00:12:04.490 --> 00:12:05.821
It's #9.

00:12:07.159 --> 00:12:08.994
It can't be!

00:12:08.994 --> 00:12:11.163
Where's #9, then?!

00:12:11.163 --> 00:12:12.665
Welcome.

00:12:12.665 --> 00:12:14.333
To the special seat.

00:12:14.333 --> 00:12:16.001
The furthest front...

00:12:16.001 --> 00:12:19.493
I'm fall... ing!

00:12:21.841 --> 00:12:25.678
How could this be!?
Tenma-chan's in the front row?

00:12:25.678 --> 00:12:26.679
All right!

00:12:26.679 --> 00:12:30.182
Yay! I'm next to Ms. Tsukamoto.

00:12:30.182 --> 00:12:31.851
Hey!

00:12:31.851 --> 00:12:34.687
How about switching seats with me?

00:12:34.687 --> 00:12:36.522
My eyesight is bad.

00:12:36.522 --> 00:12:39.047
I can't study if
I'm too far in back.

00:12:40.359 --> 00:12:42.695
- Teacher...
- What is it?

00:12:42.695 --> 00:12:44.029
My eyesight is bad.

00:12:44.029 --> 00:12:46.198
I'd like to switch to the front row.

00:12:46.198 --> 00:12:49.895
Oh. Switch places
with somebody, then...

00:12:50.703 --> 00:12:53.706
I will... I will switch with him!

00:12:53.706 --> 00:12:57.109
- Y-You will? All right, then.
So be it.
- Yes. I will. Really.

00:12:57.109 --> 00:13:01.978
- Thank you! Thank you so much!
- No, I needed to switch, too.

00:13:10.322 --> 00:13:12.625
Is your eyesight poor, Harima?

00:13:12.625 --> 00:13:16.495
Huh?! Oh! It's my sunglasses!

00:13:16.495 --> 00:13:18.986
No wonder I couldn't see!

00:13:20.966 --> 00:13:23.469
Sorry, I'm actually farsighted.

00:13:23.469 --> 00:13:26.370
I can't read the blackboard
unless I'm in the back.

00:13:27.673 --> 00:13:30.506
In other words, the special
theory of relativity is...

00:13:31.744 --> 00:13:34.474
His gaze! I can feel it on me!

00:13:37.016 --> 00:13:38.684
Yes!

00:13:38.684 --> 00:13:42.354
Well, men and women
are the same way.

00:13:42.354 --> 00:13:44.190
Seemingly close, but far apart.

00:13:44.190 --> 00:13:45.958
Seemingly far apart,
but actually close.

00:13:45.958 --> 00:13:47.858
Best seat in the house.

00:13:51.363 --> 00:13:54.196
"And even after the seasonal
change of clothes"

00:14:11.817 --> 00:14:14.887
Teacher, I'm sorry to stay so late...

00:14:14.887 --> 00:14:16.655
Oh, don't worry about it.

00:14:16.655 --> 00:14:19.825
You don't seem like someone who would
fall fast asleep during class.

00:14:19.825 --> 00:14:21.827
I really am sorry.

00:14:21.827 --> 00:14:25.965
Teacher, is my expression
so harsh, after all?

00:14:25.965 --> 00:14:27.333
Hmm?

00:14:27.333 --> 00:14:29.665
Yes, it is harsh.

00:14:32.805 --> 00:14:35.941
I'm going out for a while.
Stay as long as you like.

00:14:35.941 --> 00:14:37.408
Thank you.

00:14:46.352 --> 00:14:48.354
Why can't I get it right?

00:14:48.354 --> 00:14:50.289
Shall I tell you?

00:14:50.289 --> 00:14:51.017
Huh?

00:14:58.697 --> 00:15:02.301
You're frightened, aren't you?
I can understand.

00:15:02.301 --> 00:15:05.293
That's why you can't
put on a normal face.

00:15:07.973 --> 00:15:10.643
Are you lost? Where did you come from?

00:15:10.643 --> 00:15:12.978
There's nowhere I can go home to.

00:15:12.978 --> 00:15:16.548
After all, I'm not a normal human being.

00:15:16.548 --> 00:15:17.149
Huh?

00:15:17.149 --> 00:15:19.743
You don't believe me, do you? Yes...

00:15:20.819 --> 00:15:23.322
That can't be helped, I suppose.

00:15:23.322 --> 00:15:27.383
But despite my appearance,
I'm much older than you are.

00:15:30.129 --> 00:15:35.897
I've wandered throughout
the world, in this form.

00:15:39.672 --> 00:15:40.973
A ghost...

00:15:40.973 --> 00:15:43.237
You still don't want to
believe it, do you?

00:16:00.459 --> 00:16:05.464
Now do you believe?
I'm not a normal human.

00:16:05.464 --> 00:16:07.432
It's useless. You can't escape.

00:16:08.467 --> 00:16:13.598
I appeared because I want to ask
you something. Answer me.

00:16:15.474 --> 00:16:18.466
Do you dislike men?

00:16:19.478 --> 00:16:21.605
Or do you like them?

00:16:23.983 --> 00:16:26.986
Even after existing so long,
I don't know.

00:16:26.986 --> 00:16:32.324
Because I'm in this form.
I can't become an adult.

00:16:32.324 --> 00:16:34.159
How is it for you?

00:16:34.159 --> 00:16:38.994
Is this a difficult question for you?
Or is it easy?

00:16:43.168 --> 00:16:47.006
I don't dislike them,

00:16:47.006 --> 00:16:50.009
but I still don't have anyone
I like in particular...

00:16:50.009 --> 00:16:52.111
Even after all you've seen?

00:16:52.111 --> 00:16:53.178
Huh?

00:16:53.178 --> 00:16:56.181
I know your secret.

00:16:56.181 --> 00:17:00.285
You can read the thoughts
of boys who like you.

00:17:00.285 --> 00:17:04.456
Sometimes in the world, there are
people bound by such shackles.

00:17:04.456 --> 00:17:06.792
You are one of them.

00:17:06.792 --> 00:17:10.963
At times you can read
their deepest feelings.

00:17:10.963 --> 00:17:13.898
But you still don't dislike them. Why?

00:17:15.801 --> 00:17:18.634
It's because I can see
that I understand.

00:17:24.810 --> 00:17:27.980
Everyone is bound by
all kinds of shackles,

00:17:27.980 --> 00:17:30.210
but they're still doing their best.

00:17:31.150 --> 00:17:34.381
I don't know who
I like right now, but...

00:17:36.822 --> 00:17:38.312
- I see.
- Uh?

00:17:41.160 --> 00:17:43.458
I'll come again.

00:18:02.781 --> 00:18:05.784
Well? Did you finish, Tsukamoto-san?

00:18:05.784 --> 00:18:07.453
Oh, Teacher...

00:18:07.453 --> 00:18:11.457
Didn't you see a little girl?
With long, black hair...

00:18:11.457 --> 00:18:13.892
No, I didn't see her...

00:18:13.892 --> 00:18:14.960
Is that so?

00:18:14.960 --> 00:18:17.463
Oh! That's a pleasant expression!

00:18:17.463 --> 00:18:18.225
Huh?

00:18:23.302 --> 00:18:24.803
I'm home.

00:18:24.803 --> 00:18:29.308
Huh? Do I like boys?
Heh, heh! Umm...

00:18:29.308 --> 00:18:30.434
I love them!

00:18:32.077 --> 00:18:33.009
Sis?

00:18:36.115 --> 00:18:39.318
"On the way home after camping..."

00:18:39.318 --> 00:18:44.823
You have to visit
a hot spring in Japan...

00:18:44.823 --> 00:18:47.826
A hot-spring stay is
a must after camping!

00:18:47.826 --> 00:18:49.728
This is my first time
at a hot spring.

00:18:49.728 --> 00:18:51.830
Does it really work?

00:18:51.830 --> 00:18:53.730
Never underestimate hot springs.

00:18:56.335 --> 00:19:01.773
Should we have deceived Hanai-sempai
and left ahead of him?

00:19:01.773 --> 00:19:03.976
Perhaps you wanted to stay with him?

00:19:03.976 --> 00:19:05.603
No, that's not...

00:19:09.281 --> 00:19:12.284
Whoa, staying at a hot spring
with Yakumo-kun!

00:19:12.284 --> 00:19:14.411
It makes this camping trip worthwhile!

00:19:17.456 --> 00:19:21.790
Tenma-chan... That "I dare you"
stunt was so romantic...

00:19:22.594 --> 00:19:26.621
Tell me. Who's the girl
that you like, Harima-kun?

00:19:28.467 --> 00:19:31.970
Tenma-chan's anxiously waiting
for my confession of love.

00:19:31.970 --> 00:19:34.370
I've got to tell her soon!

00:19:37.142 --> 00:19:39.444
Wow! It's so big!

00:19:39.444 --> 00:19:41.980
Amazing view...

00:19:41.980 --> 00:19:44.574
Hey, Tsukamoto! No jumping!

00:19:45.317 --> 00:19:48.153
Ahh. The water's perfect.

00:19:48.153 --> 00:19:49.711
It feels so good!

00:19:51.290 --> 00:19:54.326
Nothing beats a hot spring,
after all.

00:19:54.326 --> 00:19:57.462
Isn't it embarrassing
soaking in the nude, though?

00:19:57.462 --> 00:19:59.665
Some places allow swimsuits.

00:19:59.665 --> 00:20:03.669
Swimsuits are wrong!
This feeling of freedom is good!

00:20:03.669 --> 00:20:04.836
D!

00:20:04.836 --> 00:20:06.672
Bastard! What're you doing?!

00:20:06.672 --> 00:20:10.509
I wonder if I can see
through this wall...

00:20:10.509 --> 00:20:12.844
Y-You fool!!

00:20:12.844 --> 00:20:14.680
- What's the big idea?
- Quit it!

00:20:14.680 --> 00:20:16.848
Hmph! Stupid.

00:20:16.848 --> 00:20:19.009
Why fool around like that
at a hot spring spa?

00:20:20.352 --> 00:20:23.322
Huh? Did you catch a cold, Eri-chan?

00:20:23.322 --> 00:20:25.357
Maybe it's because I got wet
in the "I dare you" stunt?

00:20:25.357 --> 00:20:29.361
I'm sorry. I shouldn't have
suggested we play that.

00:20:29.361 --> 00:20:32.698
But there was something
I just had to tell Harima-kun.

00:20:32.698 --> 00:20:34.097
Something to tell me?!

00:20:38.370 --> 00:20:40.872
- What did you want to tell him?
- What was it?

00:20:40.872 --> 00:20:42.374
You see...

00:20:42.374 --> 00:20:45.377
Wh-What's Tenma-chan saying?

00:20:45.377 --> 00:20:50.882
W-Was she planning to confess
her love to me that time?!

00:20:50.882 --> 00:20:54.386
I see... It was because
I was so wishy-washy...

00:20:54.386 --> 00:20:57.222
Harima-kun was even hitting on Yakumo.

00:20:57.222 --> 00:20:58.724
What!?

00:20:58.724 --> 00:21:02.361
- You're kidding!
- Harima's pathetic!

00:21:02.361 --> 00:21:05.998
- The lowest!
- That's right!

00:21:05.998 --> 00:21:08.333
Th-They're blaming me?!

00:21:08.333 --> 00:21:12.271
Because I'm so pathetic, I couldn't
tell Tenma-chan I love her...

00:21:12.271 --> 00:21:14.006
The agony of it!

00:21:14.006 --> 00:21:15.173
DD!

00:21:15.173 --> 00:21:17.232
Stop this despicable behavior!

00:21:18.677 --> 00:21:22.514
Damn! Where does he find this strength?!

00:21:22.514 --> 00:21:28.687
So I just told him straight up!
That a girl wants a boy all to herself!

00:21:28.687 --> 00:21:30.188
Hmm... And?

00:21:30.188 --> 00:21:33.025
Yes, I think he finally understood!

00:21:33.025 --> 00:21:37.362
I'm sorry, Tenma-chan...
I'm so worthless!

00:21:37.362 --> 00:21:40.032
But don't worry. Soon I'll...

00:21:40.032 --> 00:21:41.700
Nothing you say will help.

00:21:41.700 --> 00:21:44.202
He's like a monkey in mating season!

00:21:44.202 --> 00:21:45.604
You think so?

00:21:45.604 --> 00:21:46.872
Of course!

00:21:46.872 --> 00:21:50.609
All you can do with his kind
is cage him or knock him dead.

00:21:50.609 --> 00:21:52.844
I know, I could tell Nakamura...

00:21:52.844 --> 00:21:57.049
That bitch! And who the heck
is Nakamura, anyway?!

00:21:57.049 --> 00:21:58.311
DDD!!

00:21:59.384 --> 00:22:03.488
Gah... quit... quit it!
Hey! Agh!

00:22:03.488 --> 00:22:04.614
Damn you!

00:22:06.158 --> 00:22:09.685
Quit it, already!!

00:22:11.997 --> 00:22:12.986
Huh?

00:22:20.839 --> 00:22:23.008
Oh, Miko-chan...

00:22:23.008 --> 00:22:26.678
I know, since we're at a hot spring,
we've got to sing the hot-spring song.

00:22:26.678 --> 00:22:28.513
- What song?
- The one I sang earlier.

00:22:28.513 --> 00:22:29.348
Huh? What?

00:22:29.348 --> 00:22:31.149
C'mon! ...Three, four...

00:22:31.149 --> 00:22:35.253
We've come to the hot spring...

00:22:35.253 --> 00:22:38.924
We've come to the hot spring...

00:22:38.924 --> 00:22:40.692
- Go!
- Huh!?

00:22:40.692 --> 00:22:42.527
Huh? Why'd you stop?

00:22:42.527 --> 00:22:45.230
I don't know it!
Sing it by yourself!

00:22:45.230 --> 00:22:47.699
- Hot spring, hot spring...
- What's wrong, Sawachika?

00:22:47.699 --> 00:22:52.371
Huh?! N-Nothing.
I just saw a monkey pass by!

00:22:52.371 --> 00:22:54.740
Oh. We're in the mountains, after all.

00:22:54.740 --> 00:22:57.231
It's not unusual to see
a monkey or two.

00:22:58.710 --> 00:23:00.974
- Hot spring...
- Singing again?

00:23:02.647 --> 00:23:03.636
Here...

00:23:08.153 --> 00:23:12.824
Meanwhile, Takano was being
ordered to Italy on a job.

00:23:12.824 --> 00:23:14.485
Appo... [agreeing to something in Italian]

00:23:16.161 --> 00:23:17.753
Appo?

00:23:33.111 --> 00:23:40.352
What lies ahead on this endless track?

00:23:40.352 --> 00:23:44.686
I can't ask your destination

00:23:47.526 --> 00:23:54.866
With the landscape flowing by,
we're now alone on this train together

00:23:54.866 --> 00:24:00.805
Where is the terminal station
of this love?

00:24:01.640 --> 00:24:13.711
Surely you can see it, but you don't
know anything... Anything...

00:24:16.988 --> 00:24:30.265
I'll get a strong body that won't
be defeated by any kind of sorrow...

00:24:31.169 --> 00:24:34.539
Our super express of love

00:24:34.539 --> 00:24:45.279
Our journey into space
Our journey into space

00:24:46.451 --> 00:24:53.525
la lalala lalala la lalala lalala

00:24:53.525 --> 00:24:57.963
la lalalala la la la la

00:24:57.963 --> 00:25:01.421
Tenma-chan!!

00:25:14.713 --> 00:25:15.975
Kamekichi...

00:25:17.148 --> 00:25:18.308
Kame-nu.

00:25:19.651 --> 00:25:21.141
Kamekichi.

00:25:22.654 --> 00:25:23.643
Kame...

00:25:24.823 --> 00:25:26.324
No, curry...

00:25:26.324 --> 00:25:29.054
Huh?! N-No way!

00:25:35.500 --> 00:25:36.865
I'll try harder.

00:25:38.503 --> 00:25:40.266
Please do.

00:25:56.988 --> 00:26:01.493
"If the dialogue were all 'Hanga hanga,'
it would be difficult to understand."

00:26:01.493 --> 00:26:06.998
"So this episode will be dubbed
in modern Japanese."

00:26:06.998 --> 00:26:09.498
"Don't miss the next episode!"
